2026-07-27T08:22:05.8234265Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:22:05.8296387Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:22:05.8297026Z i /tmp/RtmpytiVLq/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:22:05.8297467Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:22:05.8297831Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:22:05.8298412Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:22:05.8298912Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:22:05.8299627Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:22:05.8300162Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:22:05.8543600Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:22:05.8652905Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:22:05.9146630Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:22:05.9303698Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
